<section class="auth-card"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD STARTS HERE</span><h1>Create your account</h1><p>Sign up to order, save addresses, and follow deliveries.</p><form class="form-stack" data-auth="signup"><label>Full name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" required></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Phone<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" required></label><p class="form-message" data-message></p><button class="button">Create account</button></form><p class="auth-links">Already have an account? <a href="?page=login">Sign in</a></p></section>
